  "default_coaching_notes": "Rest fully between working sets; the clock is not part of the prescription.",
  "express_rule": "drop accessory and carry volume first; the anchor lifts keep their sets",
  "micro_rule": "the anchor lift only, at the prescribed load; no intensity compensation",
  "_family_note": "The two poor-recovery sessions carry their own families rather than borrowing strength_legs, which guardrails.ts reads as HEAVY_LOWER_FAMILIES and spaces two days apart. A 3x6 goblet squat at RPE 6 is not heavy lower-body loading, and filing it as such would withdraw one of only two strength options from exactly the depleted athlete these sessions exist for."
 },
